00:07:24.267 --> 00:07:27.334
♪ My name is Linda Paulson, Republican and awesome ♪

00:07:27.334 --> 00:07:30.000
-Yeah. -[ Laughs ]

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:32.734
-At that point, the Tupac hologram unplugged itself.

00:07:32.734 --> 00:07:34.968
[ Laughter ]

00:07:34.968 --> 00:07:37.400
It's like if "Hamilton" was written by Mike Pence.

00:07:37.400 --> 00:07:38.767
Doesn't it kind of...?

00:07:38.767 --> 00:07:41.601
And finally, guys, do you ever see a photo in the news

00:07:41.601 --> 00:07:43.100
